ltman 带着 GPT-6 进白宫？OpenAI 新模型押注“Agent 团队”，或成美国首批过审模型</a></span></p>\n          <p class=\"js_darkmode__35\" data-nest-level=\"7\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 23px 8px 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(74, 74, 74);font-weight: 400;font-family: Avenir, -apple-system-font, 微软雅黑, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;white-space: pre-line;line-height: 27px;text-indent: 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"8\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><a class=\"normal_text_link mp_article_text_link\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5MDE0Mjc4MA==&amp;mid=2651289862&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=41e196ea5e4382256fc47e2ac3bff7e2&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" textvalue=\"GPT-5.6 当老板：买假用户、被Chrome干崩3小时，烧掉3亿Token收入却为0\" data-itemshowtype=\"0\" linktype=\"text\" data-linktype=\"2\">GPT-5.6 当老板：买假用户、被Chrome干崩3小时，烧掉3亿Token收入却为0</a></span></p>\n          <p class=\"js_darkmode__35\" data-nest-level=\"7\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 23px 8px 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(74, 74, 74);font-weight: 400;font-family: Avenir, -apple-system-font, 微软雅黑, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;white-space: pre-line;line-height: 27px;text-indent: 0px;\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"8\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><a class=\"normal_text_link mp_article_text_link\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;color: rgb(87, 107, 149);text-d